  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring, Evaluation, Research &amp; Learning (MERLY) services for Yemen programmes.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To deliver a holistic and adaaptable MERL service for Yemen ODA programmes. Key workstreams are to include Third-Party monitoring, analysis, evidence-generation to inform policy making and to optimise diplomatic engagement. The broader aim of MERLY will be to ensure robust accountability and VfM of ODA spend by FCDO Yemen (BE Sana&apos;a)</narrative>
  </description>
